BaseClaimPolicy::getTokensOut
├── given not initialized
│   └── it should return empty array
├── given initialized with STORAGE mode
│   ├── it should return single token for chainId
│   ├── it should return multiple tokens for chainId
│   └── it should return empty array for unconfigured chainId
├── given initialized with CATCHALL mode
│   └── it should return tokens for chainId 0
└── given storage isolation
    ├── it should isolate per configId
    └── it should isolate per account